  "description": "The SCOTT Addict Gravel 10 is your go-to gravel partner built for those who love off-road adventure, whether that’s a spirited ride or a multi-day tour. It combines the premium design characteristics of our high-end model with a drivetrain that’s more approachable and ready for any route.\n\nComfort is central to its design. The balanced geometry ensures that riding feels natural, whether you’re settling into a steady rhythm on smooth frontage roads or navigating untamed trails. For added capability and control over more off-road terrain, the HMX carbon frame can clear massive 57mm tires, opening up more routes that you’ve been wanting to ride.\n\nA payload of practical features makes it even more versatile and gives you the options to gear up for bigger days and credit-card touring. In-frame, downtube storage holds your tools and accessories, freeing up room for larger frame bags, and it fits our “Save-The-Day” kit with everything you need to handle a flat. Convenient storage in the bar ends packs away a Syncros handlebar tool and tubeless kit, while extra bottle-cage mounts on the fork ensure you stay hydrated. And to keep go-to items within reach, the top tube can secure a smaller frame bag.\n\nSmooth shifts and gearing range specific for gravel routes come from the SRAM Force XPLR AXS drivetrain and its 10–46t cassette. On long rides and demanding descents, the ergonomic hoods and one-finger braking reduce hand fatigue, so you can tick off the miles and get through the rough sections with more comfort and stamina.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
